#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:16
msgid "1. Presentation de la plateforme"
msgstr "1. Platform presentation"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:17
msgid ""
"MultiDrive est une plateforme web de consultation et de reservation de "
"vehicules d'occasion. Elle est realisee dans le cadre d'un Travail de Fin "
"d'Etudes (TFE) a titre academique et demonstratif. Les vehicules presentes "
"sont des donnees de demonstration et ne constituent pas des offres "
"commerciales reelles au sens du droit belge de la vente."
msgstr "MultiDrive is a web platform for browsing and booking used vehicles. It was created as part of a final year thesis (TFE) for academic and demonstrative purposes. The vehicles presented are demonstration data and do not constitute real commercial offers under Belgian sales law."
"MultiDrive is a web platform for browsing and booking used vehicles. It is "
"operated as part of an academic project (final year thesis). The vehicles "
"presented are demonstration data and do not constitute real commercial "
"offers."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:18
msgid ""
"Responsable de la plateforme : Younes El-Mallahi — contact : "
"multidrive25@gmail.com"
msgstr "Platform manager: Younes El-Mallahi — contact: multidrive25@gmail.com"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:22
msgid "2. Acces au service"
msgstr "2. Access to the service"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:23
msgid ""
"L'acces au catalogue est libre et gratuit. La reservation d'un vehicule "
"necessite la creation d'un compte membre. L'utilisateur doit etre age d'au "
"moins 18 ans et disposer de la capacite juridique necessaire pour "
"contracter, conformement au Code civil belge."
msgstr "Access to the catalogue is free of charge. Booking a vehicle requires creating a member account. The user must be at least 18 years old and have the legal capacity to contract, in accordance with the Belgian Civil Code."
"Access to the catalogue is free of charge. Booking a vehicle requires "
"creating a member account. MultiDrive reserves the right to suspend or "
"delete an account in the event of misuse or non-compliance with these terms."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:24
msgid ""
"MultiDrive se reserve le droit de suspendre ou de supprimer un compte en cas "
"d'utilisation abusive, de fausse identite ou de non-respect des presentes "
"conditions, sans prejudice de toute autre action legale."
msgstr ""
"MultiDrive reserves the right to suspend or delete an account in the event "
"of misuse, false identity or non-compliance with these terms, without "
"prejudice to any other legal action."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:28
msgid "3. Reservations et rendez-vous"
msgstr "3. Bookings and appointments"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:29
msgid ""
"Toute reservation est soumise a validation par l'administration. Un rendez-"
"vous peut etre propose lors de la demande, dans les plages horaires "
"definies :"
msgstr ""
"All bookings are subject to validation by the administration. An appointment "
"may be requested at the time of the booking, within the defined time slots:"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:31
msgid "Du lundi au vendredi : 16h00 a 21h30"
msgstr "Monday to Friday: 16:00 to 21:30"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:32
msgid "Le samedi et dimanche : 9h00 a 21h00"
msgstr "Saturday and Sunday: 9:00 to 21:00"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:34
msgid ""
"La confirmation de reservation n'entraine pas de transfert de propriete du "
"vehicule. Le vehicule reste disponible jusqu'au paiement effectif de "
"l'acompte ou du solde integral."
msgstr ""
"Booking confirmation does not transfer ownership of the vehicle. The vehicle "
"remains available until the deposit or full balance is actually paid."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:35
msgid ""
"Les prix et conditions de reservation sont affiches clairement avant toute "
"validation de paiement, conformement aux obligations d'information prealable "
"du consommateur prevues par le Code de droit economique belge (Livre VI)."
msgstr "Prices and booking conditions are clearly displayed before any payment confirmation, in accordance with the pre-contractual consumer information obligations set out in the Belgian Code of Economic Law (Book VI)."
"Prices and booking conditions are clearly displayed before any payment "
"confirmation."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:39
msgid "4. Paiement et securite des transactions"
msgstr "4. Payment and transaction security"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:40
msgid ""
"Un acompte peut etre demande apres acceptation de la reservation. Cet "
"acompte correspond a 20 %% du prix du vehicule, avec un minimum de 20 EUR et "
"un maximum de 250 EUR."
msgstr "A deposit may be requested after the booking is accepted. This deposit equals 20%% of the vehicle price, with a minimum of €20 and a maximum of €250."
"A deposit may be requested after the booking is accepted. This deposit "
"equals 20% of the vehicle price, with a minimum of 20 EUR and a maximum of "
"250 EUR."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:41
msgid ""
"Le paiement est traite de maniere securisee via Stripe Checkout, solution "
"certifiee PCI-DSS niveau 1, conforme aux exigences de securite bancaire "
"internationales. Les transactions sont chiffrees via HTTPS (TLS)."
msgstr "Payment is processed securely via Stripe Checkout, a PCI-DSS Level 1 certified solution compliant with international banking security standards. Transactions are encrypted via HTTPS (TLS)."
"Payment is processed securely via Stripe Checkout, a solution compliant with "
"international payment security standards (PCI-DSS). Transactions are "
"encrypted via HTTPS."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:42
msgid "Aucune donnee bancaire n'est stockee sur les serveurs de MultiDrive."
msgstr "No banking data is stored on MultiDrive's servers."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:42
msgid ""
"Les informations de carte sont traitees exclusivement par Stripe Inc. "
"(responsable de traitement independant) et ne transitent jamais par notre "
"application."
msgstr "Card information is processed exclusively by Stripe Inc. (independent data controller) and never passes through our application."
"Card information is processed exclusively by Stripe and never passes through "
"our application."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:43
msgid ""
"Conformement a la directive europeenne sur les services de paiement (DSP2), "
"les paiements en ligne sont soumis a une authentification forte (3D Secure) "
"geree par Stripe."
msgstr "In accordance with the European Payment Services Directive (PSD2), online payments are subject to strong authentication (3D Secure) managed by Stripe."
"In accordance with the European Payment Services Directive (PSD2), online "
"payments are subject to strong authentication (3D Secure) managed by Stripe."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:47
msgid "5. Annulation et remboursement"
msgstr "5. Cancellation and refund"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:48
msgid ""
"Une reservation peut etre annulee par le membre selon les conditions "
"suivantes :"
msgstr ""
"A booking may be cancelled by the member under the following conditions:"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:50
msgid ""
"Reservation en attente (pending) : annulation libre, sans frais, a tout "
"moment avant validation admin."
msgstr "Pending booking: free cancellation, no charge."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:51
msgid ""
"Reservation acceptee : annulation possible sans frais, avant tout versement."
msgstr "Accepted booking: cancellation possible, no charge."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:52
msgid ""
"Acompte verse : annulation possible. Des frais administratifs de 10 %% "
"minimum du montant verse pourront etre retenus pour couvrir les frais de "
"gestion engages."
msgstr ""
"Deposit paid: cancellation possible. An administrative fee of at least "
"10% of the amount paid may be retained."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:54
msgid ""
"Tout remboursement est traite par virement dans un delai maximal de 14 jours "
"ouvrables a compter de la validation de la demande. Le membre est informe "
"par notification dans son espace membre."
msgstr "All refunds are processed by bank transfer within a maximum of 14 working days from the approval of the request. The member is notified in their member area."
"All refunds are processed by bank transfer within a maximum of 14 working "
"days from the approval of the request. The member is notified in their "
"member area."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:55
msgid ""
"Conformement a l'article VI.47 du Code de droit economique belge, le droit "
"de retractation ne s'applique pas aux contrats de vente de biens dont la "
"valeur est susceptible de fluctuer dans un delai court."
msgstr "In accordance with Article VI.47 of the Belgian Code of Economic Law, the right of withdrawal does not apply to contracts for the sale of goods whose value is subject to fluctuation within a short period."
"In accordance with Article VI.47 of the Belgian Code of Economic Law, the "
"right of withdrawal does not apply to contracts for the sale of goods whose "
"value is subject to fluctuation within a short period."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:59
msgid "6. Donnees personnelles"
msgstr "6. Personal data"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:60
msgid ""
"Le traitement des donnees personnelles est regi par le Reglement (UE) "
"2016/679 du Parlement europeen et du Conseil (RGPD) et par la loi belge du "
"30 juillet 2018 relative a la protection des personnes physiques a l'egard "
"des traitements de donnees a caractere personnel."
msgstr "The processing of personal data is governed by Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council (GDPR) and by the Belgian law of 30 July 2018 on the protection of natural persons with regard to the processing of personal data."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:61
msgid ""
"Pour le detail complet de la politique de traitement des donnees, veuillez "
"consulter notre"
msgstr "For full details of our data processing policy, please consult our"

