msgstr "Privacy policy"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:66
msgid "7. Cookies"
msgstr "7. Cookies"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:67
msgid ""
"MultiDrive utilise uniquement des cookies techniques strictement necessaires "
"au bon fonctionnement de la plateforme :"
msgstr ""
"MultiDrive only uses technical cookies required for its operation (session, "
"security, language). No advertising cookies."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:69
msgid "Maintien de la session utilisateur (authentification Django)"
msgstr "Maintaining the user session (Django authentication)"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:70
msgid "Protection contre les attaques CSRF (securite des formulaires)"
msgstr "Protection against CSRF attacks (form security)"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:71
msgid "Memorisation de la preference de langue (choix FR / NL / EN)"
msgstr "Remembering the language preference (FR / NL / EN)"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:73
msgid ""
"Ces cookies sont strictement necessaires et ne necessitent pas de "
"consentement prealable conformement a la directive europeenne ePrivacy "
"(2002/58/CE) et a la recommandation de l'Autorite de Protection des Donnees "
"belge. Aucun cookie publicitaire, analytique ou tiers n'est utilise."
msgstr "These cookies are strictly necessary and do not require prior consent in accordance with the European ePrivacy Directive (2002/58/EC) and the recommendation of the Belgian Data Protection Authority. No advertising, analytical or third-party cookies are used."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:77
msgid "8. Propriete intellectuelle"
msgstr "8. Intellectual property"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:78
msgid ""
"Les contenus presentes sur MultiDrive (design, code source, textes, elements "
"graphiques) sont proteges par la loi belge du 19 avril 2014 relative au "
"droit d'auteur et aux droits voisins et par la Convention de Berne. Toute "
"reproduction ou diffusion sans autorisation prealable est interdite."
msgstr "The content presented on MultiDrive (design, source code, texts, graphics) is protected by the Belgian law of 19 April 2014 on copyright and related rights and by the Berne Convention. Any reproduction or distribution without prior authorisation is prohibited."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:79
msgid ""
"Ce projet est realise a titre academique dans le cadre d'un Travail de Fin "
"d'Etudes. Les images utilisees pour illustrer les vehicules proviennent de "
"ressources libres de droits ou appartiennent au projet."
msgstr "This project is carried out for academic purposes as part of a final year thesis. The images used to illustrate vehicles come from royalty-free resources or belong to the project."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:83
msgid "9. Responsabilite"
msgstr "9. Liability"

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:84
msgid ""
"MultiDrive est un projet academique fourni a titre demonstratif. La "
"plateforme est mise a disposition en l'etat, sans garantie de disponibilite "
"continue. MultiDrive ne saurait etre tenu responsable des dommages directs "
"ou indirects resultant de l'utilisation ou de l'impossibilite d'utiliser le "
"service."
msgstr "MultiDrive is an academic project provided for demonstrative purposes. The platform is provided as-is, without guarantee of continuous availability. MultiDrive cannot be held liable for direct or indirect damages resulting from the use or inability to use the service."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:85
msgid ""
"En cas de litige, les parties s'engagent a rechercher une solution amiable "
"avant tout recours judiciaire. Le droit belge est applicable. Les tribunaux "
"de Bruxelles sont seuls competents."
msgstr "In the event of a dispute, the parties agree to seek an amicable solution before taking legal action. Belgian law applies. The courts of Brussels have sole jurisdiction."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:89
msgid "10. Modification des conditions"
msgstr "Change saved."

#: .\vehicles\templates\vehicles\cgv.html:90
msgid ""
"MultiDrive se reserve le droit de modifier les presentes conditions a tout "
"moment. Les utilisateurs seront informes de toute modification "
"substantielle. La version en vigueur est celle affichee sur cette page avec "
"la date de derniere mise a jour."
msgstr "MultiDrive reserves the right to modify these terms at any time. Users will be informed of any substantial changes. The version in force is the one displayed on this page with the last update date."

